/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
/build/
/coverage/

# Temporary build artifacts (HTML docs at root level only)
/com/

# iOS Podfile.lock in example
example/ios/Podfile.lock

# Markdown
*.md
!README.md
!**/README.md
# Package docs that must ship in the published archive
